From c6d2715de40191e4fd8b2b1502da4f8b44323e02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:31:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD route selected-agent slash commands through backend
 command hooks

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent chat messages through the provider command hook so backend-native commands such as /status and /fork are not wrapped as ordinary prompts. The provider contract keeps default unsupported-command behavior for existing implementations, while Codex maps command execution to the same resume path used for follow-up input.
